*2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Diabrollow]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
