==Strategy==
The stage begins with 2 Heavenly Hippoes, 3 Diabrollows, all while Dogenstein continuously appear through the run. Use this time to build up your wallet.

It's actually pretty hard to run out of cash here, so you can let yourself spam stuff here. Use [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] for the Angel enemies, while your generic attackers like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N106 (Rare Cat)|Mushroom Cat]], [[Food Stall Cat (Rare Cat)|Cafeteria Cat]], [[Talents|Talented]] [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Dancer Cat]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], and talented [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon Cat]] wreck havoc.

[[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Soractes]] in particular cooks here, being able to Freeze lock the Angels and having [[Sage Slayer]]. You can use [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] as well for Diabrollow's Waves.

